            <ArticleTitle>[Churg-Strauss syndrome--case report].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>73-83</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Churg-Strauss syndrome (CSS) is a rare systemic vasculitis, that essentially affects medium-sized vessels, involves multiple organs and in the majority of cases is related to asthma and eosinophilia. The authors make a review of this disease and discuss its differential diagnosis presenting the case of a woman with asthma that at the age of 65 is diagnosed with CSS.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
